{"seq":2,"slug":"combinatorial-optimization","title":"研究生 高级算法 — 组合优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/optimization-algo/combinatorial-optimization","wordCount":1639,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-高级算法-组合优化\">研究生 高级算法 — 组合优化</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>组合优化处理的是在有限（但通常指数级大）的候选方案中寻找最优解的问题。与凸优化的连续光滑结构不同，组合优化的核心挑战来自离散结构——整数变量、图论约束、排列组合使得穷举不可行。研究生阶段需要掌握多面体理论、整数规划技术、网络流算法，以及松弛与舍入的近似策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题类</th>\n<th>代表问题</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>核心技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最短路径</td>\n<td>Dijkstra, Bellman-Ford</td>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>动态规划 / 贪心</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大流</td>\n<td>Ford-Fulkerson, Push-Relabel</td>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>增广路径 / 预流推进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小生成树</td>\n<td>Kruskal, Prim</td>\n<td>P</td>\n<td>贪心 + 并查集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旅行商问题</td>\n<td>TSP</td>\n<td>NP-hard</td>\n<td>分支定界 / LP 松弛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背包问题</td>\n<td>0-1 Knapsack</td>\n<td>NP-hard</td>\n<td>DP 伪多项式 / FPTAS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图着色</td>\n<td>k-Coloring</td>\n<td>NP-complete (k≥3)</td>\n<td>SDP 松弛 / 贪心</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"多面体理论与整数规划\">多面体理论与整数规划</h3><p>整数规划（IP）是组合优化的统一建模框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>x</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min c^T x \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad Ax \\leq b,\\ x \\in \\mathbb{Z}^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0273em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>LP 松弛去掉整数约束后得到多面体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\{x \\mid Ax \\leq b\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 的所有顶点恰好是整数点时（称为整数多面体），LP 松弛直接给出整数最优解。全幺模矩阵（TU）是判定整数多面体的关键工具——若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是 TU 矩阵且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为整数向量，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是整数多面体。</p>\n<p>网络流问题的约束矩阵天然满足 TU 性质，这解释了为什么最大流、最小费用流等问题可在多项式时间内精确求解。</p>\n<p><strong>分支定界法</strong>：对 LP 松弛求解，若最优解非整数，选择一个分数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i = f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 创建两个子问题（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i \\leq \\lfloor f \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i \\geq \\lceil f \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>），递归求解。剪枝策略决定实际效率：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[LP 松弛求解] --&gt;|整数解| B[记录可行解]&#10;    A --&gt;|分数解| C{选择分支变量}&#10;    C --&gt; D[x_i ≤ floor]&#10;    C --&gt; E[x_i ≥ ceil]&#10;    D --&gt; F[求解子 LP]&#10;    E --&gt; G[求解子 LP]&#10;    F --&gt;|下界 &gt; 当前最优| H[剪枝]&#10;    F --&gt;|下界 ≤ 当前最优| A&#10;    G --&gt;|下界 &gt; 当前最优| H&#10;    G --&gt;|下界 ≤ 当前最优| A\">graph TD\n    A[LP 松弛求解] --&gt;|整数解| B[记录可行解]\n    A --&gt;|分数解| C{选择分支变量}\n    C --&gt; D[x_i ≤ floor]\n    C --&gt; E[x_i ≥ ceil]\n    D --&gt; F[求解子 LP]\n    E --&gt; G[求解子 LP]\n    F --&gt;|下界 &gt; 当前最优| H[剪枝]\n    F --&gt;|下界 ≤ 当前最优| A\n    G --&gt;|下界 &gt; 当前最优| H\n    G --&gt;|下界 ≤ 当前最优| A</pre><p><strong>割平面法</strong>：通过添加线性不等式（割平面）切掉分数解但保留所有整数可行解。Gomory 割是通用的割平面生成方法，而 Traveling Salesman 等特定问题有更强的割平面族（子巡回消除约束、梳子不等式）。</p>\n<p>现代求解器（Gurobi, CPLEX）结合分支定界与割平面，称为分支切割法（Branch-and-Cut），是求解大规模整数规划的工业标准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网络流与匹配\">网络流与匹配</h3><p>网络流理论连接了图论与线性规划。最大流-最小割定理（Ford-Fulkerson）是对偶理论在组合结构上的完美体现。</p>\n<p><strong>最大流算法演进</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ford-Fulkerson：沿增广路径推流，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><msup><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(VE^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（Edmonds-Karp 的 BFS 策略）</li>\n<li>Push-Relabel：维护预流和标号函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V^2 E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，实践中最快</li>\n<li>Dinic：层次图 + 阻塞流，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V^2 E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在单位容量网络中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><msqrt><mi>V</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(E\\sqrt{V})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>二部图匹配</strong>：最大匹配可通过最大流求解（构造超级源/汇）。König-Egerváry 定理揭示二部图中最大匹配 = 最小顶点覆盖。Hungarian 算法以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 求解带权最大匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>最小费用流</strong>：综合考虑容量约束和流量费用，LP 对偶给出互补松弛条件，Successive Shortest Path 算法基于此设计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"近似算法策略\">近似算法策略</h3><p>当精确求解不可行时，近似算法在可证明的质量保证下高效求解。</p>\n<p><strong>LP 松弛 + 舍入</strong>：求解 LP 松弛得到分数解，通过随机或确定性舍入得到整数解。集合覆盖问题的贪心 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\ln n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-近似和 LP 舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>-近似（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 为元素最大出现次数）是经典案例。</p>\n<p><strong>原始-对偶方法</strong>：同时构造原始可行解和对偶可行解，用对偶目标值作为近似比的下界。Steiner 树的 2-近似和设施选址的 3-近似均基于此框架。</p>\n<p><strong>半正定松弛</strong>：Goemans-Williamson 算法用 SDP 松弛 MAX-CUT 问题，配合随机超平面舍入，达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.878</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.878</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.878</span></span></span></span></span>-近似比——这个比率在唯一博弈猜想下是最优的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"现代求解技术\">现代求解技术</h3><p><strong>列生成</strong>：当变量数量指数级大时，只维护当前基的变量子集，通过求解定价子问题（pricing problem）动态添加有利变量。车辆路径问题（VRP）和大规模排班问题广泛使用此技术。</p>\n<p><strong>Lagrangian 松弛</strong>：将困难约束移入目标函数（加入 Lagrange 乘子惩罚），分解为易解的子问题。子梯度法更新乘子逼近对偶最优。经典应用包括设施选址和调度问题。</p>\n<p><strong>SAT 与 CSP 求解器</strong>：布尔可满足性（SAT）求解器通过 DPLL 搜索 + 冲突驱动学习（CDCL）处理百万变量规模的实例。许多组合优化问题可编码为 SAT 或约束满足问题（CSP），借助通用求解器获得高效解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>证明完全二部图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{n,n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的邻接矩阵是全幺模矩阵。由此推导匹配多面体的完整线性描述。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>实现 Edmonds-Karp 最大流算法并在随机生成的网络上与 Dinic 算法比较运行时间。讨论不同网络结构（稠密 vs. 稀疏、单位容量 vs. 大容量）下的性能差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>考虑 TSP 的 LP 松弛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum c_e x_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（子巡回消除约束）。说明为什么直接求解此 LP 不可行（约束数量指数级），并描述割平面法如何按需添加违反的子巡回约束。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个启发式算法求解 50 城市的 TSP 实例。比较最近邻、2-opt 改进和 Christofides 3/2-近似算法的解质量。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Schrijver, <em>Combinatorial Optimization: Polyhedra and Efficiency</em> — 多面体理论的百科全书</li>\n<li>Korte &amp; Vygen, <em>Combinatorial Optimization: Theory and Algorithms</em> — 研究生标准教材</li>\n<li>Williamson &amp; Shmoys, <em>The Design of Approximation Algorithms</em> — 近似算法的现代处理</li>\n<li>Wolsey, <em>Integer Programming</em> — 整数规划的实践导向教材</li>\n<li>Gurobi 官方文档与示例 — 工业级求解器的使用指南</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>组合优化的思维方式是&quot;结构利用与近似折中&quot;：多面体理论揭示问题的几何结构，整数规划提供统一建模框架，网络流展示了多项式可解的丰富结构，近似算法在 NP-hard 的困境中给出有保证的近似解。现代求解器将这些理论技术融合为分支切割、列生成等工程化方法，使得大规模实例的求解成为可能。下一步建议学习元启发式方法，了解工程实践中精确求解与启发式搜索的互补关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 高级算法 — 组合优化","id":"研究生-高级算法-组合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"多面体理论与整数规划","id":"多面体理论与整数规划"},{"level":3,"text":"网络流与匹配","id":"网络流与匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"近似算法策略","id":"近似算法策略"},{"level":3,"text":"现代求解技术","id":"现代求解技术"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 高级算法 — 凸优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/optimization-algo/convex-optimization"},"next":{"title":"研究生 高级算法 — 元启发式算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/advanced-algorithms/optimization-algo/metaheuristics"}}